  "body": "I am using web bluetooth to read sensors data from headset. It works perfectly fine as it does BLE connection to headset and read characteristics from GATT services.\r\n\r\nWhen using web BT to read sensor data, i need to play audio over bluetooth. To play Audio over bluetooth, i make classic Bluetooth connection from laptop thru bluetooth setting. Once classic BT connection happens, gatt.connect() api is non-responsive. My question is how to play audio using bluetooth while using web bluetooth for GATT characteristics. ",
